# NyayOS Dashboard API

Backend API + Dashboard for the NyayOS hackathon project.

## Setup

```bash
npm install
node seed.js   # populate demo cases (run once)
npm start      # starts on port 3000
```

## Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | /cases | Bolna webhook — creates a new case |
| GET | /cases | List all cases (filterable) |
| GET | /cases/:id | Full case detail |
| PATCH | /cases/:id/status | Update case status |
| GET | /health | Health check |

## Query Filters (GET /cases)
- `?issue_type=unpaid_salary`
- `?urgency=high`
- `?status=draft_generated`
- Combine any: `?issue_type=fir_refusal&urgency=high`

## Valid Values

**issue_type:** `unpaid_salary` | `fir_refusal` | `deposit_withheld` | `pension_delay`

**status:** `new` | `info_needed` | `draft_generated` | `submitted` | `followup_due` | `resolved`

**urgency:** `high` | `medium` | `low`

## Bolna Integration

Tell your teammate to set this webhook URL in Bolna:
```
POST https://YOUR-RENDER-URL.onrender.com/cases
```

The dashboard auto-refreshes every 30 seconds.